  "abstract": "Single-parameter phenomenological extension of LCDM motivated by EFC, where entropy-gradient couplings at structure-formation scale modify both background expansion and linear growth rate. Best-fit alpha_L2 = 0.35 +/- 0.16 with Delta-chi-squared = 3.01 (1.7-sigma preference). BAO-RSD sign conflict reflects S8 tension in EFC parameter space.",
